      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Questions from patients about analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. The topics addressed in this issue are osteoporosis and osteomalacia, with a discussion of conservative management, including kyphoplasty, vertebral augmentation, pain control, and quality of life."},
